              "text": "orbus, orba, orbum — \"orphaned; childless, bereft\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Puella orba ab avunculō ēducāta est. The orphaned girl was brought up by her uncle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bereft of parents or of children; with the ablative, bereft of anything."
            }
          ]
        },
